# error: 20:7: `h.o` owns a `Bag?`, which can't be copied by `=`: write `+h.o` to clone it or `?h.o` to view it
# error: 25:7: `h.o` owns a `Bag?`, which can't be copied by `=`: write `<h.o` to take it out (leaving `none`), `+h.o` to clone it, or `?h.o` to view it
